            <div class="sectionA plh-top">
        <div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_topGrid_ctl02" class="module hero text-in-box align-text-left bg-color-a" style="background-image:url('/Media/638681253079059608/Mark og å - COLOURBOX7376239.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c2000%2c1124')">
	<div class="text">
<div class="wrap">
<h1 class="heading">
Den Gr&#248;nne Trepart
</h1><div class="rich-text">
<p>Styrelsen for Gr&oslash;n Arealoml&aelig;gning og Vandmilj&oslash; arbejder med implementering af Gr&oslash;n Trepart-aftalen.</p>
<p><a href="/groen-trepart" class="link-arrow" data-type="internal" data-id="28157">Den Gr&oslash;nne Trepart</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></div>
    

    
    
            <div class="sectionC plh-bottom">
        <div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl02" class="module spacer hide-in-mobile" style="height:20px">
	
</div><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="span-3"><div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl03" class="module multi-box bg-color-a card">
	<div class="media">
<a target="_blank" href="/groen-trepart/kvaelstofregulering-og-arealomlaegning"><picture>
<source media="(max-width: 480px)" srcset="/Media/638737440376593821/colourbox12936785.webp?crop=0%2c200%2c1917%2c1080&width=480"><source media="(max-width: 678px)" srcset="/Media/638737440376593821/colourbox12936785.webp?crop=0%2c200%2c1917%2c1080&width=678"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/Media/638737440376593821/colourbox12936785.webp?crop=0%2c200%2c1917%2c1080&width=768"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="/Media/638737440376593821/colourbox12936785.webp?crop=0%2c200%2c1917%2c1080&width=300"><source media="(max-width: 1920px)" srcset="/Media/638737440376593821/colourbox12936785.webp?crop=0%2c200%2c1917%2c1080&width=480"><img loading="lazy" src="/Media/638737440376593821/colourbox12936785.webp?crop=0%2c200%2c1917%2c1080&amp;width=768" data-decorative="true" alt="" />
</picture></a>
</div><div class="text">
<h2 class="heading">
<a target="_blank" href="/groen-trepart/kvaelstofregulering-og-arealomlaegning">Kv&#230;lstofregulering og arealoml&#230;gning</a>
</h2><div class="rich-text">
<p><span>Den&nbsp;</span>udledningsbaserede markregulering tr&aelig;der i kraft den 1. januar 2027. L&aelig;s om den nye regulering, herunder udledningsgr&aelig;nser, oplandskategorier, planl&aelig;gningsv&aelig;rkt&oslash;j og kompensationsordning.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div><div class="span-3"><div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl04" class="module multi-box bg-color-a card">
	<div class="media">
<a target="_blank" href="https://lbst.dk/tilskud/tilskudsguide"><picture>
<source media="(max-width: 480px)" srcset="/Media/638732201470570806/Majsmark.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c554%2c312&width=480&quality=60"><source media="(max-width: 678px)" srcset="/Media/638732201470570806/Majsmark.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c554%2c312&width=554&quality=60"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/Media/638732201470570806/Majsmark.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c554%2c312&width=554&quality=60"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="/Media/638732201470570806/Majsmark.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c554%2c312&width=300&quality=60"><source media="(max-width: 1920px)" srcset="/Media/638732201470570806/Majsmark.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c554%2c312&width=480&quality=60"><img loading="lazy" src="/Media/638732201470570806/Majsmark.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c554%2c312" data-decorative="true" alt="" />
</picture></a>
</div><div class="text">
<h2 class="heading">
<a target="_blank" href="https://lbst.dk/tilskud/tilskudsguide">Tilskudsguide</a>
</h2><div class="rich-text">
<p>I vores tilskudsguide kan du f&aring; overblik over, hvilke tilskud du kan s&oslash;ge. Find ogs&aring; vejledninger, ans&oslash;gningsskemaer og frister for de enkelte tilskud.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div><div class="span-3"><div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl05" class="module multi-box bg-color-a card">
	<div class="media">
<a target="_self" href="/groen-trepart/lokale-treparter"><picture>
<source media="(max-width: 480px)" srcset="/Media/638731362258319106/Forside%20vaadomraade.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c899%2c506&width=480"><source media="(max-width: 678px)" srcset="/Media/638731362258319106/Forside%20vaadomraade.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c899%2c506&width=678"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/Media/638731362258319106/Forside%20vaadomraade.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c899%2c506&width=768"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="/Media/638731362258319106/Forside%20vaadomraade.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c899%2c506&width=300"><source media="(max-width: 1920px)" srcset="/Media/638731362258319106/Forside%20vaadomraade.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c899%2c506&width=480"><img loading="lazy" src="/Media/638731362258319106/Forside%20vaadomraade.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c899%2c506&amp;width=768" data-decorative="true" alt="" />
</picture></a>
</div><div class="text">
<h2 class="heading">
<a target="_self" href="/groen-trepart/lokale-treparter">Lokale Treparter</a>
</h2><div class="rich-text">
<p>Dette er den centrale indgang for de lokale treparters arbejde med oml&aelig;gningsplaner. L&aelig;s om indsatsbehov for kv&aelig;lstof, potentiale for udtagning af lavbundsjorder og om IT-platformen MARS.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div><div class="span-3"><div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl06" class="module multi-box bg-color-a card">
	<div class="media">
<a target="_blank" href="https://sgavmst.dk/arter/artsforvaltning/beskyttede-arter/ulv"><picture>
<source media="(max-width: 480px)" srcset="/Media/638829906246923740/web_eskil-j-nielsen-ferreira_20221014_borrishede-288.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c1918%2c1079&width=480"><source media="(max-width: 678px)" srcset="/Media/638829906246923740/web_eskil-j-nielsen-ferreira_20221014_borrishede-288.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c1918%2c1079&width=678"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/Media/638829906246923740/web_eskil-j-nielsen-ferreira_20221014_borrishede-288.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c1918%2c1079&width=768"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="/Media/638829906246923740/web_eskil-j-nielsen-ferreira_20221014_borrishede-288.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c1918%2c1079&width=300"><source media="(max-width: 1920px)" srcset="/Media/638829906246923740/web_eskil-j-nielsen-ferreira_20221014_borrishede-288.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c1918%2c1079&width=480"><img loading="lazy" src="/Media/638829906246923740/web_eskil-j-nielsen-ferreira_20221014_borrishede-288.jpg?crop=0%2c0%2c1918%2c1079&amp;width=768" alt="" />
</picture></a>
</div><div class="text">
<h2 class="heading">
<a target="_blank" href="https://sgavmst.dk/arter/artsforvaltning/beskyttede-arter/ulv">Gode r&#229;d om ulve</a>
</h2><div class="rich-text">
<p>F&aring; gode r&aring;d om ulve i de tre pjecer: "S&aring;dan f&aelig;rdes du trygt i naturen", "Pas p&aring; din hund i naturen" og "Undg&aring; at tiltr&aelig;kke ulve n&aelig;r din bolig".&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div></div></div><div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl07" class="module spacer hide-in-mobile" style="height:20px">
	
</div><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="span-12"><div id="gb_ContentPlaceHolderDefault_bottomGrid_ctl08" class="module dynamic-list item-list">
